<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon cuts five natgas cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon cuts five natgas cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Donald Dufresne downgraded five natural gas companies, citing a decline in natural gas prices over the last few weeks.</p>
<p>-- Cut Columbia Gas System Inc, Consolidated Natural Gas Co, Enron Corp, Questar Corp and Sonat Inc to hold from buy. </p>
<p>-- Maintained buy ratings on Williams Cos Inc, K N Energy Inc and El Paso Energy Corp, noting the three have limited exploration and production exposure, good earnings growth potential and are probable acquisition candidates. </p>
<p>-- Also maintained buy ratings on Coastal Corp and Mitchell Energy &amp; Development Energy Corp.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
